TICVAI INVENTORY & PROCUREMENT — BOARD 1
Inventory Master & Stock Control — Scope of Work
1. Purpose
The Inventory Master & Stock Control Board shall provide the centralized enterprise inventory foundation for 
TICVAI.
It shall maintain a single source of truth for inventory items, SKU references, stock states, locations, quantities, 
batches, lots, serial numbers, expiry, reorder parameters, movement history, and stock control rules across all 
TICVAI modules.
This Board shall be consumed by:
 Food & Beverage
 Retail
 Rental
 Resource Management
 Operations
 Event Operations
 Warehouses
 Procurement
 Finance
 Employee App
 B2C / Guest App where applicable
 Reporting & AI
The core inventory model shall follow:
Inventory Item Category Attributes UOM Tracking Method Stock Location Quantity Stock → → → → → → →
Status Batch/Lot/Serial Availability Movement Cost Audit → → → → →

TICVAI / INVENTORY & PROCUREMENT BACKEND STRUCTURE
CONFIDENTIAL | 5
The dedicated Inventory matrix requires centralized item management, categories, SKU/barcode management, 
configurable product attributes and variants, UOM management, real-time inventory, multi-location/multiwarehouse stock, available/reserved/on-order/in-transit/damaged quantities, movements, adjustments, returns, 
write-offs, stock counts, reorder parameters, alerts and batch/lot/serial/expiry tracking.
