PAGE 2 — Inventory Item Master
Purpose
Provide a centralized master record for every inventory-controlled item in TICVAI.
The Inventory Item Master shall be separate from a Retail sellable product or F&B menu item.
For example:
Retail Product: TICVAI T-Shirt
↓
SKU: Black / Medium
↓
Inventory Item: INV-RET-TSH-BLK-M
or:
F&B Menu Product: Classic Burger
↓
Recipe
↓
Inventory Items: Beef Patty, Bun, Cheese, Sauce.
General Information
Capture:
 Inventory Item Name
 Inventory Item Code
 SKU Reference
 Barcode
 Item Type
 Category
 Subcategory
 Description

