 Item
 Location
 Warehouse
 Store
 Outlet
 Season
 Time Period
Core Fields
 Minimum Stock
 Maximum Stock
 Safety Stock
 Reorder Point
 Reorder Quantity
 Par Level
 Lead Time
 Review Frequency
Example
Retail T-Shirt / Main Gift Shop
Minimum:
20
Maximum:
100
Safety:
15
Reorder Point:
35
Reorder Quantity:
65
Different Location Profiles
The same item may have different thresholds.

