AI — Inventory Data Quality Assistant
AI should identify configuration problems proactively.
Example:
14 inventory items appear to be duplicates based on name, barcode and supplier reference.
Suggested Action:
Review Potential Duplicates
Another example:
22 items have purchase UOM defined as Case but no Case-to-Base-UOM conversion.
AI — Stock Risk Detection
Even at Board 1 level, TICVAI should identify immediate stock-control risks.
Example:
Beef Patty
Current Available:
72
Reserved / Forecast Immediate Demand:
64
Incoming:
0
Result:
High shortage risk
Recommendation:
Review other locations for internal redistribution.
The actual demand forecasting engine will be handled in Board 6.

