Work
1. Purpose
The RFQ, Supplier Quotation, Sourcing & Purchase Order Management Board shall provide TICVAI with the 
centralized commercial procurement execution layer for converting approved purchasing demand into controlled 
supplier sourcing and Purchase Orders.
Board 4 established:
What needs to be purchased Internal stock check Purchase Request Approval Consolidated → → → →
procurement demand.
Board 5 shall establish:
How do we source it? Which suppliers should be invited? What did each supplier offer? Which offer → → →
provides the best overall value? Who approves the award? How is the Purchase Order created and → →
controlled?
The core lifecycle shall follow:
Approved Demand Sourcing Strategy RFQ Supplier Quotations Commercial / Technical Evaluation → → → → →
Comparison Negotiation Award Recommendation Approval Purchase Order Supplier → → → → →
Acknowledgement Order Tracking →
