AI — RECOMMENDATION GOVERNANCE
AI recommendations shall have configurable execution modes.
Level 1 — Insight Only
AI displays information.
Level 2 — Recommendation
AI recommends an action.
Level 3 — Draft Action
AI creates:
 Draft Transfer
 Draft PR
 Draft Replenishment
Level 4 — Auto-Execute Within Policy
Only where explicitly enabled.
Example:
Automatically create internal replenishment below AED 500 equivalent operational value.
Level 5 — Approval Required
AI creates action and routes it through the Approval Engine.
I recommend TICVAI default to Levels 2–3, with Level 4 enabled only for clearly defined low-risk workflows.
